================================================================================
  OMKNEEHEALTH KNEE SCORE MODULE - SHOPIFY INTEGRATION GUIDE
================================================================================

  This document provides guidance for integrating the Knee Score Results 
  and Recommendations modules into your Shopify store.

  FILES INCLUDED:
  ---------------
  1. sections/omkneehealth-knee-reco.liquid   - Full recommendation calculator
  2. sections/knee-score-results.liquid       - Results display with anchor sections
  3. sections/knee-sleep-score.liquid         - Score calculator (existing)

================================================================================
  ANCHOR IDS FOR CTA NAVIGATION
================================================================================

  The following anchor IDs are available for smooth-scroll navigation:

  REACT APP (score.omkneehealth.com):
  -----------------------------------
  - #shop-supplements    → Product CTA section
  - #evidence-science    → Evidence & Science section (Science page)
  - #how-to-use          → How to Use section (Product page)
  - #product-faq         → FAQ section (Product page)

  SHOPIFY SECTIONS:
  -----------------
  - #knee-recommendations → Main recommendations panel
  - #shop-supplements     → Shop supplements section
  - #evidence-science     → Evidence & Science section
  - #book-imaging         → Book imaging section

  EXAMPLE CTA LINKS:
  ------------------
  - href="#shop-supplements"              → Scrolls to supplements on same page
  - href="/products/joint-support#shop-supplements" → Goes to product + scrolls
  - href="/pages/science#evidence-science"          → Goes to science page section
  - href="https://mykneescan.com"                   → External imaging booking
  - href="https://sportshealing.com"                → External clinician booking

================================================================================
  RECOMMENDED PLACEMENTS
================================================================================

  1. PRODUCT PAGE (Joint Supplement)
  ----------------------------------
  Position: Below "How to take" section, above "FAQs"
  
  In Shopify theme editor:
  - Go to Online Store → Themes → Customize
  - Navigate to Product page template
  - Add section "Knee Score Results" after product description/how-to-use
  - Configure settings:
    • Show Shop Section: false (already on product page)
    • Show Evidence Section: true
    • Show Imaging Section: true

  Section order should be:
  a. Product Hero
  b. Product Description / Suitability
  c. Ingredients
  d. Safety
  e. How to Use         ← existing
  f. Knee Score Results ← ADD HERE
  g. FAQ                ← existing
  h. Product CTA


  2. DEDICATED LANDING PAGE
  -------------------------
  Position: Below the score calculator, above testimonials
  
  Create a new page template:
  - Go to Online Store → Themes → Customize
  - Create new template: "page.knee-score"
  - Add sections in this order:
    a. Hero/Header section
    b. knee-sleep-score (calculator)
    c. omkneehealth-knee-reco (full recommendation engine)
    d. knee-score-results (display sections with CTAs)
    e. Testimonials
    f. Final CTA

  OR use as standalone page with calculator + results:
  - Create page: /pages/knee-score-calculator
  - Add sections:
    a. Custom Hero
    b. knee-sleep-score
    c. omkneehealth-knee-reco
    d. knee-score-results


  3. HOMEPAGE
  -----------
  Position: After main value proposition, before product showcase
  
  Use the knee-score-results section as a teaser:
  - Show Shop Section: true
  - Show Evidence Section: false
  - Show Imaging Section: false
  
  This creates a "Shop by concern" section that links to the full calculator.


  4. COLLECTION PAGE
  ------------------
  Position: Above the product grid
  
  Add knee-score-results with:
  - Hide imaging section
  - Show shop collection (auto-populates with collection products)


================================================================================
  SHOPIFY PAGE TEMPLATE EXAMPLE
================================================================================

  For a dedicated "Knee Score Calculator" page template:

  {% raw %}
  {
    "sections": {
      "main": {
        "type": "knee-sleep-score",
        "settings": {}
      },
      "recommendations": {
        "type": "omkneehealth-knee-reco",
        "settings": {
          "score_source": "index",
          "shop_collection_url": "/collections/joint-optimisation",
          "imaging_booking_url": "https://mykneescan.com",
          "clinician_booking_url": "https://sportshealing.com"
        }
      },
      "results": {
        "type": "knee-score-results",
        "settings": {
          "show_shop_section": true,
          "show_evidence_section": true,
          "show_imaging_section": true
        }
      }
    },
    "order": ["main", "recommendations", "results"]
  }
  {% endraw %}


================================================================================
  CROSS-SITE NAVIGATION (React App ↔ Shopify)
================================================================================

  When the React calculator at score.omkneehealth.com generates recommendations,
  CTAs should link to the main Shopify store:

  - Shop Joint Support → https://omkneehealth.com/products/joint-support#shop-supplements
  - View Evidence      → https://omkneehealth.com/pages/science#evidence-science
  - Read FAQs          → https://omkneehealth.com/products/joint-support#product-faq

  When embedding the calculator on Shopify via iframe:
  - Use relative links within the same domain
  - Or use target="_parent" to navigate the parent frame


================================================================================
  IFRAME EMBEDDING (if using React calculator on Shopify)
================================================================================

  If embedding the React calculator in Shopify:

  <iframe 
    src="https://score.omkneehealth.com/assessment" 
    width="100%" 
    height="800"
    frameborder="0"
    allow="clipboard-write"
    loading="lazy"
    style="border: none; max-width: 100%;">
  </iframe>

  Note: Cross-origin navigation from iframe requires target="_blank" or 
  postMessage communication for seamless navigation.

================================================================================
